WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:01.701
-Welcome back. We're here

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.234
with Martin Lawrence right here!

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:03.934
Now...

00:00:03.934 --> 00:00:05.634
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:08.868
Martin, I want to talk
about the reunion special

00:00:08.868 --> 00:00:11.367
-Yes.
-because what did it feel like

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:13.801
to have the original cast back
together after all this time?

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:15.934
-It felt great, man,
just to see them again

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:17.200
and get back together.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.200
It felt like we was going back
to work, you know,

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.300
and only thing that was missing
was our brother Tommy Ford.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.501
-Agh!
[ Claps ]

00:00:23.501 --> 00:00:25.434
-But we got to honor him
in the right way.

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:28.934
[ Applause ]
-Aw, he was great.

00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:31.033
I mean, is everyone still
just funny and so like

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:32.734
-Yes.
-you go right back to the days,

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:34.067
-Yes.
you're like, "Oh, we could do
this right now"?

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:36.200
-Yes, when you see the reunion,
you'll see the humor

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.267
and the laughter in the reunion,
you know.

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:39.968
We just pick up
where we left off.

00:00:39.968 --> 00:00:41.334
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:43.801
-These are some of the
characters, of course,

00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:45.067
that you talk about.

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:46.601
Dragonfly Jones.

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:48.634
[ Laughter ]
I think

00:00:48.634 --> 00:00:50.200
Sheneneh Jenkins,

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.701
Romey Rome, and Roscoe.

00:00:51.701 --> 00:00:54.667
I think, still, my favorite
thing is Dragonfly Jones,

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:55.968
[ Laughter ]
when he -- Do you remember when

00:00:55.968 --> 00:00:57.367
he got in a fight
in the parking lot?

00:00:57.367 --> 00:00:58.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.834 --> 00:01:00.400
Well, I'm saying it
like it's not you.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.534
[ Laughter ]
You, as Dragonfly,

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:05.300
and then you went up and you
dialed 911 on the ATM machine.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.200
[ Laughter ]
-Right, right, right.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.834
-You were dialing, 911.

00:01:09.834 --> 00:01:13.234
One of the best physical comedy
things ever.

00:01:13.234 --> 00:01:14.934
Would you ever
do the show again?

00:01:14.934 --> 00:01:16.234
People want to know.

00:01:16.234 --> 00:01:17.067
-I think --

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:19.868
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:23.067
Well, you know,
the "Martin" show was like

00:01:23.067 --> 00:01:24.868
catching lightning in a bottle

00:01:24.868 --> 00:01:29.367
and I don't think we can redo
that again, you know.

00:01:29.367 --> 00:01:32.400
I wouldn't mind working with the
cast again on something,

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.701
but I don't think we could do
that again.

00:01:34.701 --> 00:01:37.267
-Maybe like, instead of the
Marvel Cinematic Universe,

00:01:37.267 --> 00:01:38.968
it's the Martin
Cinematic Universe.

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:42.400
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah. Well, I would love to see
a movie with Sheneneh.

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:43.200
[ Cheering, yeahs, applause ]
-Yes!

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.901
-And, remember, we were supposed

00:01:44.901 --> 00:01:47.167
to do a movie with Sheneneh
and Jamie Foxx,

00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:49.767
with Wanda,
and that never came about.

00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:51.801
[ Laughter ]
But if we could ever get
that together,

00:01:51.801 --> 00:01:52.968
I think y'all would love that.
-Ooh, my God.

00:01:52.968 --> 00:01:54.868
[ Cheering and applause ]
No, that would be --

00:01:54.868 --> 00:01:57.367
You got to do that.
-Yeah.

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:59.634
-You have to do that.
Or even like I could see like

00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:02.667
did anyone ever pitch you
like "Lil Martin" or anything?

00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:04.567
[ Laughter ]
Like a cartoon or something
like that?

00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:05.734
Because you got all these
great characters.

00:02:05.734 --> 00:02:07.234
-Yeah, we got some stuff coming.
-You do? Alright.

00:02:07.234 --> 00:02:08.834
-Yeah.
-You know we love you.

00:02:08.834 --> 00:02:10.467
Come back whenever you want to.
-Love you, man.

00:02:10.467 --> 00:02:12.033
-Martin Lawrence,
the one and only.

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:14.801
[ Cheering and applause ]
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:16.400
Here's a peek
at "Martin: The Reunion."

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.133
Take a look at this.

00:02:18.133 --> 00:02:22.501
-You guys felt so natural,
so cultural and it felt --

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:24.534
Did you know that that was
the approach you wanted

00:02:24.534 --> 00:02:26.033
to take or...?

00:02:26.033 --> 00:02:28.000
-We just went for it, you know.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.000
I don't know if that's the
approach I wanted to take,

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.334
but I was in the moment.

00:02:31.334 --> 00:02:34.033
We were in the moment
and we were just going for it.

00:02:34.033 --> 00:02:36.934
We wanted the show to succeed
and we just did

00:02:36.934 --> 00:02:39.667
everything we could to try
to make that happen.

00:02:39.667 --> 00:02:40.567
-You're being a little humble.

00:02:40.567 --> 00:02:41.767
-Yeah.
You know you humble.

00:02:41.767 --> 00:02:42.968
Stop playing.

00:02:42.968 --> 00:02:45.634
First of all,
he was driving the bus

00:02:45.634 --> 00:02:47.334
and you had to keep up.

00:02:47.334 --> 00:02:48.467
-He was funny.

00:02:48.467 --> 00:02:50.901
You had to anticipate
his movements.

00:02:50.901 --> 00:02:53.634
You didn't know where he was
going to go at any moment.

00:02:53.634 --> 00:02:56.067
He was freaking brilliant!

00:02:56.067 --> 00:02:57.834
-Yeah, that's exactly right!

00:02:57.834 --> 00:03:00.501
[ Cheering and applause ]
Martin Lawrence, everybody!

00:03:00.501 --> 00:03:03.634
"Martin: The Reunion"
is streaming now on BET+.

